# desktop-vm: boot this repo's desktop in QEMU/KVM, on a screen, without touching your live session
# (qemu-base itself comes from runner-up/packages: this VM boots runner-up's cloud image)
edk2-ovmf                      # UEFI firmware: OVMF_CODE.4m.fd / OVMF_VARS.4m.fd
qemu-hw-display-virtio-gpu-gl  # the GL GPU device; pulls virglrenderer (host GL for the guest)
qemu-hw-display-virtio-vga-gl  # virtio-vga-gl: the display mango runs on (real GLES, not software VGA)
qemu-ui-egl-headless           # egl-headless display for virgl (pulls qemu-ui-opengl); QMP screendump has no surface
